Package: harbour-seuche
Version: @VERSION@
Section: user/games
Priority: optional
Architecture: armel
Depends: libqt4-declarative, libqt4-network, libqt4-script, libqt4-gui, qt-components
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/smatkovi/harbour-seuche
Description: Co-operative disease board game
 Seuche is a co-operative board game for two to four players on one device:
 four diseases break out around the world, and the table wins only by
 discovering a cure for all four before eight outbreaks happen, a cube supply
 runs dry or the player deck runs out. Two to four phones can also share one
 table over Wi-Fi.
 .
 MeeGo Harmattan edition of the Sailfish OS app; same rule core, own interface.
